  "sewing_notes": [
    "1. U-Panel Prep: Mark fold guidelines on 1000D Cordura U-Panel. Stitch Grab Handles, Pull Tabs, and Roll-Top Webbing Straps.",
    "2. Pocket Construction: Stitch 2 magnets into Front 3D Pocket rim and 2 matching magnets in Front Flap. Stitch pocket to Front U-Panel section; install rear mesh pocket with center magnetic snap.",
    "3. Side Gussets: Bartack brush sleeves to Left Gusset and D-Ring to Right Gusset.",
    "4. Shell Assembly (Continuous Seam): Pin Left and Right Gussets along the continuous side perimeter of the U-Panel and stitch with 1/2in SA. Zero bottom seams!",
    "5. Ultrasuede Gasket: Encapsulate 4 pairs of 18mm N52 magnets inside the two Ultrasuede Rim Gasket bands.",
    "6. Anti-Puff Baffles: Hem 70D Ripstop Baffles and baste 1in below Ultrasuede rim.",
    "7. Fleece Lining Assembly: Stitch Fleece U-Panel to Fleece Gussets leaving a 4in turning opening along one side seam.",
    "8. Final Perimeter Join: Sandwich exterior Ultrasuede collar, anti-puff baffles, and fleece lining around top perimeter; topstitch with 1/4in margin."
  ]
}
